# Wave T26 (Copperton kit): cutstonefloor — Copperton's
# avenue stone and registered street kind (the fleet's street
# kinds carry the -floor suffix: settfloor, marblefloor,
# wornfloor, avenuefloor, violetfloor — the desire-path tiers
# key on it). Big square-cut quarry flags, two by two per
# tile: bevelled light top/left edges, copper-brown joint
# shadow, sparse stone speckle and one faint copper stain.
# Warm grey, in the rustboro ground tones (#a39684 family).
# Not Farsight's gold avenue slabs and not pale sand: quarry
# flags read as company-city stone at screenshot scale.
# (NO-SAME-KIT law.)
